# Planning the day: tasks in the TODAY project join Today with the dated ones, a dated one put first in Today, and the same list after reopening.
file <<END
TODAY:
	- Call the bank @due({today})
	- Water plants
Work:
	- Review PRs
	- Write report @due({today})
END
keys gt
see - Water plants
hide Review PRs
keys G <A-k> <A-k>
restart
see 󰖙 Today
keys gg x
quit
saved <<END
TODAY:
	- Call the bank @due({today})
	- Water plants
Work:
	- Review PRs
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
END
